                %a{:href => "http://mathoverflow.net/questions/67909/what-extra-conditions-are-necessary-for-the-following-version-of-koszul-duality"} what-extra-conditions-are-necessary-for-the-following-version-of-koszul-duality
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/David+Eisenbud"}> David Eisenbud
                , Gunnar Fløystad, Frank-Olaf Schreyer:
                %em Sheaf cohomology and free resolutions over
              %p
                exterior algebras_, Trans. Amer. Math. Soc.
                %strong 355
                (2003) 4397-4426 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "http://www.ams.org/mathscinet-getitem?mr=1990756"} MR1990756
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "http://dx.doi.org/10.1090/S0002-9947-03-03291-4"} doi:10.1090/S0002-9947-03-03291-4
            %li
