                  %em Koszul duality and equivalences of categories
                %strong 358
                (2006), 2373-2398
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/math/0012264"} math.AG/0012264
                %a{:href => "http://www.ams.org/mathscinet-getitem?mr=2204036"} MR2204036
                %a{:href => "http://dx.doi.org/10.1090/S0002-9947-05-04035-3"} doi
          %p
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Bernhard+Keller"} Bernhard Keller
            and his student Lefèvre-Hasegawa described rather general framework for Koszul duality using dg-(co)algebras and
